      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;One80 (일팔공) content repo: JLPT N5-N1 track — config, curriculum, prompts, dummy units, site

Five pass/fail levels on 180-point papers, 80 books planned (8/7/20/20/25),
Japanese headwords with kana readings behind the card. Twenty real words per
level are seeded as dummy units so the app can be exercised; the overnight
pipeline clears them before the real build. Site and policies rebranded to
the hinomaru palette with footage slots.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
